{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ea2997c16f21d1e8502b066bfc9db4a","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;bridemoonpalace&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n Looks great!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;Thanks so much! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1797323,"PostDate":1378238179,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>bridemoonpalace<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Looks great!<\/div> <\/div> <p>Thanks so much! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ldoney1013@aol.com","IpAddress":"70.20.201.223","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1328121597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250839.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LaLa1116","Id":250839,"Name":"LaLa1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b6f345c90bf8233595b450876d2c9ef","RawContent":"[quote name=\"LaLa1116\"]\nThanks you!!  You aren&#039;t far from us, Jersey girl. ;) Where in Mexico are you getting married? I purchased the bags from Etsy seller, Ciera Design, but it was a while ago and it doesn&#039;t look like she sells them anymore.  They are square glassine vellum bags.  I searched Etsy and it looks like this seller, Laserbird, has the same thing available.  They were very easy to print on with our at-home printer.  If you have any questions, don&#039;t hesitate to ask! :) Here is the link for the bags sold by [url=\"http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/92573365\/50-mini-vellum-envelopes?ref=sr_gallery_3&amp;ga_search_query=glassine+vellum+bags&amp;ga_view_type=gallery&amp;ga_ship_to=US&amp;ga_search_type=all\"]Laserbird[\/url].[\/quote] Thanks so much for the inspiration. I bought glassine bags and was able to figure out how to print on them! They came out great!!! Looking forward to seeing more of your projects! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1797758,"PostDate":1378370536,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"LaLa1116\" url=\"\/t\/86227\/las&#045;diy&#045;blog\/0_100#post_1942852\"><p>Thanks you!!\u00a0 You aren't far from us,\u00a0Jersey girl. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> Where in Mexico are you getting married? I purchased the bags from Etsy seller, Ciera Design, but it was a while ago and it doesn't look like she sells them anymore.\u00a0 They are square glassine vellum bags.\u00a0 I searched Etsy and it looks like this seller, Laserbird, has the same thing available.\u00a0 They were very easy to print on with our at-home printer.\u00a0 If you have any questions, don't hesitate to ask! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Here is the link for the bags sold by <a href='http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/92573365\/50-mini-vellum-envelopes?ref=sr_gallery_3&ga_search_query=glassine+vellum+bags&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_ship_to=US&ga_search_type=all' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Laserbird<\/a>.<\/p><\/blockquote> Thanks so much for the inspiration. I bought glassine bags and was able to figure out how to print on them! They came out great!!! Looking forward to seeing more of your projects! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Cookieg617@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.193.163.24","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1337724829,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"LoriGran","Id":255715,"Name":"LoriGran","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a046afc1c14f2378b01eaa446a2717de","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Lori Granados&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n \n Thanks so much for the inspiration. I bought glassine bags and was able to figure out how to print on them! They came out great!!! Looking forward to seeing more of your projects! :)&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Yay!&amp;nbsp; Glad to help! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1798154,"PostDate":1378493680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>Lori Granados<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Thanks so much for the inspiration. I bought glassine bags and was able to figure out how to print on them! They came out great!!! Looking forward to seeing more of your projects! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Yay!\u00a0 Glad to help! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ldoney1013@aol.com","IpAddress":"70.20.201.223","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1328121597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250839.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LaLa1116","Id":250839,"Name":"LaLa1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"81c1f53b631f7d1c5790ad198fda975f","RawContent":"Thank you this is very helpful!","Attachments":[],"Id":1801807,"PostDate":1379803810,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you this is very helpful!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrzzmel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.88.170.244","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357523912,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263989.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrzzMel","Id":263989,"Name":"MrzzMel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5542c975bd83a630718b792e30e8a32a","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;MrzzMel&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n Thank you this is very helpful!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Great! &amp;nbsp;Glad to hear it! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1801879,"PostDate":1379853142,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>MrzzMel<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Thank you this is very helpful!<\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Great! \u00a0Glad to hear it! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ldoney1013@aol.com","IpAddress":"70.20.201.223","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1328121597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250839.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LaLa1116","Id":250839,"Name":"LaLa1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cceee896af65d68fc39291ec85f630dd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is an awesome thread....I think your theme is very in line with what i&#039;m trying to pull off a nice rustice beach wedding with a little mexican theme.&amp;nbsp; Thanks for the inspirations and tips.&amp;nbsp; Can&#039;t wait to see how everything turns out at the wedding.&amp;nbsp; Post lots of pics!!&amp;nbsp; Only a couple more days yay how exciting!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810743,"PostDate":1383220513,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is an awesome thread....I think your theme is very in line with what i'm trying to pull off a nice rustice beach wedding with a little mexican theme.\u00a0 Thanks for the inspirations and tips.\u00a0 Can't wait to see how everything turns out at the wedding.\u00a0 Post lots of pics!!\u00a0 Only a couple more days yay how exciting!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357660461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e03cbbab9e557f4420417fbb275c793d","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/86227\/las-diy-blog\/50#post_1958813\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;NJBride2014&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;This is an awesome thread....I think your theme is very in line with what i&#039;m trying to pull off a nice rustice beach wedding with a little mexican theme.&amp;nbsp; Thanks for the inspirations and tips.&amp;nbsp; Can&#039;t wait to see how everything turns out at the wedding.&amp;nbsp; Post lots of pics!!&amp;nbsp; Only a couple more days yay how exciting!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;Thanks so much! &amp;nbsp;Glad it gave you some inspiration! &amp;nbsp;Can&#039;t believe my wedding is so soon...time really does fly! &amp;nbsp;I have some more DIY pics to post and will definitely include some wedding photos when we return. &amp;nbsp;Happy planning! :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810831,"PostDate":1383233117,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/86227\/las-diy-blog\/50#post_1958813\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>NJBride2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>This is an awesome thread....I think your theme is very in line with what i'm trying to pull off a nice rustice beach wedding with a little mexican theme.\u00a0 Thanks for the inspirations and tips.\u00a0 Can't wait to see how everything turns out at the wedding.\u00a0 Post lots of pics!!\u00a0 Only a couple more days yay how exciting!!!<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>Thanks so much! \u00a0Glad it gave you some inspiration! \u00a0Can't believe my wedding is so soon...time really does fly! \u00a0I have some more DIY pics to post and will definitely include some wedding photos when we return. \u00a0Happy planning! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ldoney1013@aol.com","IpAddress":"70.20.201.223","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1328121597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250839.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LaLa1116","Id":250839,"Name":"LaLa1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8fd5f7dd77b8a3164fd9ce0c31397402","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is all fabulous! Amazing job! and has given me some great ideas!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810835,"PostDate":1383234085,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is all fabulous! Amazing job! and has given me some great ideas!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krisdaversa@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"70.29.31.208","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382024686,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274333.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"krisdaversa","Id":274333,"Name":"krisdaversa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac2be1d42ad7d66c65ae898edaf1760c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Girls!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;So we leave TOMORROW!!! I can&#039;t believe it!&amp;nbsp; As I pack up our d\u00a9cor, I took some last minute photos of projects I forgot to share with all of you.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;As I mentioned before, we will be giving out flip flops at the reception...they will be displayed in a basket&amp;nbsp;on a table with this sign.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226373\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226373\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;We are also having a s&#039;mores bar with gourmet marshmallows that I ordered from Sweet Jumbles on Etsy.&amp;nbsp; I highly recommend her shop!&amp;nbsp; The marshmallows are ridiculously good and she was a pleasure to work with!&amp;nbsp; I shared the sign with the flavors in an earlier post, but here is a pic of the \"s&#039;more love\" sign that will also be on the table.&amp;nbsp; The flavors are nutella pb, coconut, horchata (cinnamon &amp;amp; sugar) and Mexican chocolate.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226374\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226374\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Here are some pictures of the welcome packet folders for the welcome bags.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226375\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226375\/width\/200\/height\/400\" style=\"width:97px\" width=\"200\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226376\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226376\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226377\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226377\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;I used plain white folders, printed a LOVE logo on a clear&amp;nbsp;full&amp;nbsp;page label and applied it to the front.&amp;nbsp; I used this technique to print the welcome to Puerto Vallarta label for the inside pocket.&amp;nbsp; The following items are inside every folder.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;a short welcome message&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;a palm tree pen (from Oriental Trading)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;a handmade bookmark (featured in an earlier post)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;personalized post it notes and Puerto Vallarta post cards (both were made on Vista Print)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;a small camera cutout with a message on the back&amp;nbsp;reminding guests to share their pictures with us&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;a welcome booklet with the wedding week activities&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;a pv pub crawl book with all the bars and descriptions listed&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;a facebook with pictures of all guests&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;information about the resort including free golf tee times, a map of Dreams and a list of restaurants&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; activities&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;a calendar called \"hang with the bride and groom when they&#039;re not in their room\" so guests know where to find us.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;a \"do not disturb\" door sign&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226378\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226378\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226379\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226379\/width\/200\/height\/400\" style=\"width:132px\" width=\"201\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226380\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226380\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226381\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226381\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226382\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226382\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226383\/\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226383\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226383\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226384\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226384\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226385\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226385\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226386\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226386\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1813683,"PostDate":1384113293,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Girls!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>So we leave TOMORROW!!! I can't believe it!\u00a0 As I pack up our d\u00a9cor, I took some last minute photos of projects I forgot to share with all of you.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>As I mentioned before, we will be giving out flip flops at the reception...they will be displayed in a basket\u00a0on a table with this sign.<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226373\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226373\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>We are also having a s'mores bar with gourmet marshmallows that I ordered from Sweet Jumbles on Etsy.\u00a0 I highly recommend her shop!\u00a0 The marshmallows are ridiculously good and she was a pleasure to work with!\u00a0 I shared the sign with the flavors in an earlier post, but here is a pic of the \"s'more love\" sign that will also be on the table.\u00a0 The flavors are nutella pb, coconut, horchata (cinnamon & sugar) and Mexican chocolate.<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226374\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226374\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Here are some pictures of the welcome packet folders for the welcome bags.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226375\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226375\/width\/200\/height\/400\" style=\"width:97px\" width=\"200\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226376\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226376\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226377\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226377\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>I used plain white folders, printed a LOVE logo on a clear\u00a0full\u00a0page label and applied it to the front.\u00a0 I used this technique to print the welcome to Puerto Vallarta label for the inside pocket.\u00a0 The following items are inside every folder.<\/p> <p>a short welcome message<\/p> <p>a palm tree pen (from Oriental Trading)<\/p> <p>a handmade bookmark (featured in an earlier post)<\/p> <p>personalized post it notes and Puerto Vallarta post cards (both were made on Vista Print)<\/p> <p>a small camera cutout with a message on the back\u00a0reminding guests to share their pictures with us<\/p> <p>a welcome booklet with the wedding week activities<\/p> <p>a pv pub crawl book with all the bars and descriptions listed<\/p> <p>a facebook with pictures of all guests<\/p> <p>information about the resort including free golf tee times, a map of Dreams and a list of restaurants\u00a0& activities<\/p> <p>a calendar called \"hang with the bride and groom when they're not in their room\" so guests know where to find us.<\/p> <p>a \"do not disturb\" door sign<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226378\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226378\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226379\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226379\/width\/200\/height\/400\" style=\"width:132px\" width=\"201\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226380\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226380\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226381\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226381\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226382\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226382\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226383\/\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226383\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226383\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226384\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226384\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226385\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226385\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226386\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226386\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ldoney1013@aol.com","IpAddress":"70.20.201.223","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1328121597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250839.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LaLa1116","Id":250839,"Name":"LaLa1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f1a720922a620d88056620f3adfd3508","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;More pics of welcome packet contents... \"hang with the bride and groom\" calendar, a map of pv featuring Dreams and Las Caletas and a Spanish language guide.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226387\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226387\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226390\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226390\/width\/200\/height\/400\" style=\"width:153px\" width=\"201\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226389\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226389\/width\/200\/height\/400\" style=\"width:165px\" width=\"200\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;As I mentioned in an earlier post, guests will light sparklers for our first dance.&amp;nbsp; These are sparkler cards I made to hold them.&amp;nbsp; The say, \"Light the way when our song begins to play.\"&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226392\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226392\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Because we are having a cigar bar, sparklers and wish lanterns, we thought we should get some personalized match boxes.&amp;nbsp; I found these on Etsy and thought they were so cool!&amp;nbsp; I asked the shop to use glitter in our colors and only include less morbid pictures...while I love Day of the Dead stuff, I didn&#039;t think it was appropriate for a wedding. (This&amp;nbsp;picture is from the website, because ours are packed away.)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/img0.etsystatic.com\/000\/0\/5121784\/il_300x300.344543398.jpg\" width=\"107\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;At the ceremony entrance, we will have a table set-up with white wayfarer sunglasses and wooden fans in baskets... There will be a \"Be Cool\" sign in front of the basket of fans and a \"Stay Cool\" sign in front of the sunglasses.&amp;nbsp; Thought this was a nice touch for guests sitting in the sun during our ceremony.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img id=\"irc_mi\" src=\"http:\/\/www.chowsemporium.co.uk\/chows\/WoodenFan1.JPG\" style=\"margin-top:0px; width:129px\" width=\"393\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img id=\"irc_mi\" src=\"http:\/\/cn1.kaboodle.com\/hi\/img\/2\/0\/0\/11f\/5\/AAAAAkyepYUAAAAAAR9UaQ.jpg?v=1216648888000\" style=\"margin-top:57px; width:120px\" width=\"280\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1813685,"PostDate":1384114440,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>More pics of welcome packet contents... \"hang with the bride and groom\" calendar, a map of pv featuring Dreams and Las Caletas and a Spanish language guide.<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226387\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226387\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226390\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226390\/width\/200\/height\/400\" style=\"width:153px\" width=\"201\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226389\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226389\/width\/200\/height\/400\" style=\"width:165px\" width=\"200\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>As I mentioned in an earlier post, guests will light sparklers for our first dance.\u00a0 These are sparkler cards I made to hold them.\u00a0 The say, \"Light the way when our song begins to play.\"<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"226392\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226392\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Because we are having a cigar bar, sparklers and wish lanterns, we thought we should get some personalized match boxes.\u00a0 I found these on Etsy and thought they were so cool!\u00a0 I asked the shop to use glitter in our colors and only include less morbid pictures...while I love Day of the Dead stuff, I didn't think it was appropriate for a wedding. (This\u00a0picture is from the website, because ours are packed away.)<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/img0.etsystatic.com\/000\/0\/5121784\/il_300x300.344543398.jpg\" width=\"107\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>At the ceremony entrance, we will have a table set-up with white wayfarer sunglasses and wooden fans in baskets... There will be a \"Be Cool\" sign in front of the basket of fans and a \"Stay Cool\" sign in front of the sunglasses.\u00a0 Thought this was a nice touch for guests sitting in the sun during our ceremony.<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"irc_mi\" src=\"http:\/\/www.chowsemporium.co.uk\/chows\/WoodenFan1.JPG\" style=\"margin-top:0px; width:129px\" width=\"393\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"irc_mi\" src=\"http:\/\/cn1.kaboodle.com\/hi\/img\/2\/0\/0\/11f\/5\/AAAAAkyepYUAAAAAAR9UaQ.jpg?v=1216648888000\" style=\"margin-top:57px; width:120px\" width=\"280\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ldoney1013@aol.com","IpAddress":"70.20.201.223","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1328121597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250839.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LaLa1116","Id":250839,"Name":"LaLa1116","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":75,"TotalPages":8,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":70},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
