{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f7b5e0528b90435f6c51303afe4c001","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Here are some of the table signs that will be displayed during the ceremony...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are calling our specialty cocktail, \"Horchata Colada.\"&amp;nbsp; For anyone who&amp;nbsp;has never had or heard of&amp;nbsp;horchata; it is delicious!&amp;nbsp; I think the best way to describe it is \"the milk left in the bowl after a huge bowl of cinnamon toast crunch.\" :D&amp;nbsp; It is a traditional Mexican drink made with rice milk and cinnamon.&amp;nbsp; We are adding Malibu coconut rum to make it extra tasty.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377484625728_4503\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217850\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217850\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are also having a s&#039;mores bar at the reception.&amp;nbsp; I ordered some fun homemade marshmallows on Etsy: coconut, Mexican chocolate, pb nutella and horchata (cinnamon &amp;amp; sugar).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377484625728_4974\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217851\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217851\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This sign will go on our wish lantern table.&amp;nbsp; We are planning on asking our guests to write a wish for us on the lantern before we release them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377484625728_5300\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217852\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217852\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Sparklers will be displayed on the same table as the lanterns.&amp;nbsp; I made sparkler cards that say \"Light the Way, When Our Song Begins to Play.\"   This sign will inform guests when to use their sparklers.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377484625728_5631\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217854\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217854\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This sign will be displayed on our escort card table.&amp;nbsp; We are using the sand dollar xmas ornaments (posted earlier) as escort cards.&amp;nbsp; This sign explains the significance of the ornaments.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377484625728_5958\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217855\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217855\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1794632,"PostDate":1377472844,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Here are some of the table signs that will be displayed during the ceremony...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are calling our specialty cocktail, \"Horchata Colada.\"\u00a0 For anyone who\u00a0has never had or heard of\u00a0horchata; it is delicious!\u00a0 I think the best way to describe it is \"the milk left in the bowl after a huge bowl of cinnamon toast crunch.\" <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0 It is a traditional Mexican drink made with rice milk and cinnamon.\u00a0 We are adding Malibu coconut rum to make it extra tasty.<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377484625728_4503\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217850\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217850\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are also having a s'mores bar at the reception.\u00a0 I ordered some fun homemade marshmallows on Etsy: coconut, Mexican chocolate, pb nutella and horchata (cinnamon & sugar).\u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377484625728_4974\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217851\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217851\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This sign will go on our wish lantern table.\u00a0 We are planning on asking our guests to write a wish for us on the lantern before we release them.\u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377484625728_5300\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217852\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217852\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sparklers will be displayed on the same table as the lanterns.\u00a0 I made sparkler cards that say \"Light the Way, When Our Song Begins to Play.\"\u00a0\u00a0 This sign will inform guests when to use their sparklers.<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377484625728_5631\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217854\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217854\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This sign will be displayed on our escort card table.\u00a0 We are using the sand dollar xmas ornaments (posted earlier) as escort cards.\u00a0 This sign explains the significance of the ornaments.<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377484625728_5958\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217855\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217855\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ldoney1013@aol.com","IpAddress":"70.20.201.223","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1328121597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250839.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LaLa1116","Id":250839,"Name":"LaLa1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"69459fbd5995a465ddbd9d09e08aded2","RawContent":"What a great planning thread!!!! Thanks for sharing! If I may ask ... Where did you get the bags for your wedding survival kit?","Attachments":[],"Id":1794641,"PostDate":1377475098,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                What a great planning thread!!!! Thanks for sharing! If I may ask ... Where did you get the bags for your wedding survival kit?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Cookieg617@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.193.163.24","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1337724829,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"LoriGran","Id":255715,"Name":"LoriGran","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"756b573a1184aabae54e829dae2e9cf3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks you!!&amp;nbsp; You aren&#039;t far from us,&amp;nbsp;Jersey girl. ;) Where in Mexico are you getting married?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I purchased the bags from Etsy seller, Ciera Design, but it was a while ago and it doesn&#039;t look like she sells them anymore.&amp;nbsp; They are square glassine vellum bags.&amp;nbsp; I searched Etsy and it looks like this seller, Laserbird, has the same thing available.&amp;nbsp; They were very easy to print on with our at-home printer.&amp;nbsp; If you have any questions, don&#039;t hesitate to ask! :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here is the link for the bags sold by &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/92573365\/50-mini-vellum-envelopes?ref=sr_gallery_3&amp;amp;ga_search_query=glassine+vellum+bags&amp;amp;ga_view_type=gallery&amp;amp;ga_ship_to=US&amp;amp;ga_search_type=all\"&gt;Laserbird&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1794782,"PostDate":1377517918,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks you!!\u00a0 You aren't far from us,\u00a0Jersey girl. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> Where in Mexico are you getting married?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I purchased the bags from Etsy seller, Ciera Design, but it was a while ago and it doesn't look like she sells them anymore.\u00a0 They are square glassine vellum bags.\u00a0 I searched Etsy and it looks like this seller, Laserbird, has the same thing available.\u00a0 They were very easy to print on with our at-home printer.\u00a0 If you have any questions, don't hesitate to ask! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here is the link for the bags sold by <a href='http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/92573365\/50-mini-vellum-envelopes?ref=sr_gallery_3&ga_search_query=glassine+vellum+bags&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_ship_to=US&ga_search_type=all' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Laserbird<\/a>.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ldoney1013@aol.com","IpAddress":"70.20.201.223","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1328121597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250839.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LaLa1116","Id":250839,"Name":"LaLa1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7daac68ff59a523d9e5d4df976c5fe0f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I just finished the bookmarks we are putting in our oot bags.&amp;nbsp; I used the Phillie Phanatic image again and wrote, \"You were here.\"&amp;nbsp; Thought it was a cute play on words&amp;nbsp;meaning, \"this is where you were in your book\" and also&amp;nbsp;\"you were in Mexico.\"&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377533671773_903\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217871\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217871\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are planning on giving guests a late night snack (Mexican wedding cookies) to take home after our welcome party.&amp;nbsp; I found these cookies on Amazon and I made the bags with our at-home printer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377533671773_1572\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217872\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217872\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1794802,"PostDate":1377519997,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I just finished the bookmarks we are putting in our oot bags.\u00a0 I used the Phillie Phanatic image again and wrote, \"You were here.\"\u00a0 Thought it was a cute play on words\u00a0meaning, \"this is where you were in your book\" and also\u00a0\"you were in Mexico.\"\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377533671773_903\"> \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217871\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217871\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are planning on giving guests a late night snack (Mexican wedding cookies) to take home after our welcome party.\u00a0 I found these cookies on Amazon and I made the bags with our at-home printer.\u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377533671773_1572\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217872\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217872\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ldoney1013@aol.com","IpAddress":"70.20.201.223","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1328121597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250839.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LaLa1116","Id":250839,"Name":"LaLa1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d4f7e5d75e840b76dea3afb6b2371284","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Well brides, so much for attempting to post everything in&amp;nbsp;order, LOL.&amp;nbsp; I have been taking pictures as I complete things, so I apologize if all of this bouncing back and forth&amp;nbsp;confuses anyone.  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This is our \"here comes the bride\" sign that our ring bearer and flower girl will carry.&amp;nbsp; The back says, \"just married\".&amp;nbsp; I purchased it on Etsy.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377533671773_1958\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217873\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217873\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217874\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217874\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This is a close-up picture of the&amp;nbsp;hand-cut banderas flags that I mentioned in the beginning of this blog.&amp;nbsp; We are giving them to guests at the ceremony to wave around when we&amp;nbsp;are pronounced husband and wife. :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377533671773_2625\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217875\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217875\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1794809,"PostDate":1377520732,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Well brides, so much for attempting to post everything in\u00a0order, LOL.\u00a0 I have been taking pictures as I complete things, so I apologize if all of this bouncing back and forth\u00a0confuses anyone.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This is our \"here comes the bride\" sign that our ring bearer and flower girl will carry.\u00a0 The back says, \"just married\".\u00a0 I purchased it on Etsy.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377533671773_1958\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217873\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217873\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span>\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217874\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217874\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This is a close-up picture of the\u00a0hand-cut banderas flags that I mentioned in the beginning of this blog.\u00a0 We are giving them to guests at the ceremony to wave around when we\u00a0are pronounced husband and wife. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377533671773_2625\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217875\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217875\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ldoney1013@aol.com","IpAddress":"70.20.201.223","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1328121597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250839.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LaLa1116","Id":250839,"Name":"LaLa1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"543717beb442ed9aa47b72d00519313f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Ok, here are our ring bearer and flower girl gifts...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My niece is our flower girl.&amp;nbsp; She is 2 years old.&amp;nbsp; We are giving her a mermaid hooded beach towel embroidered with her name (ETSY), a flower headband for the ceremony (ETSY) and a flower girl book.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377547974608_861\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217905\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217905\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217908\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217908\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217922\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217922\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My nephew is our ring bearer.&amp;nbsp; He is 4 years old.&amp;nbsp; We are giving him a shark hooded towel, a personalized sand bucket with a shark (we bought this in red) and his name (he LOVES sharks!) and a bowtie to wear&amp;nbsp;for the ceremony.&amp;nbsp; All were purchased from Etsy.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377547974608_1878\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217923\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217923\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217924\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217924\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217925\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217925\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1794969,"PostDate":1377534102,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Ok, here are our ring bearer and flower girl gifts...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My niece is our flower girl.\u00a0 She is 2 years old.\u00a0 We are giving her a mermaid hooded beach towel embroidered with her name (ETSY), a flower headband for the ceremony (ETSY) and a flower girl book.<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377547974608_861\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217905\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217905\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span>\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217908\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217908\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span>\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217922\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217922\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My nephew is our ring bearer.\u00a0 He is 4 years old.\u00a0 We are giving him a shark hooded towel, a personalized sand bucket with a shark (we bought this in red) and his name (he LOVES sharks!) and a bowtie to wear\u00a0for the ceremony.\u00a0 All were purchased from Etsy.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1377547974608_1878\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217923\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217923\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span>\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217924\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217924\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span>\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"217925\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/217925\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ldoney1013@aol.com","IpAddress":"70.20.201.223","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1328121597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250839.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LaLa1116","Id":250839,"Name":"LaLa1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5fab79b3f99213d11ad94701bc86c24a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"LaLa1116\"]\nThanks you!!  You aren&#039;t far from us, Jersey girl. ;) Where in Mexico are you getting married? I purchased the bags from Etsy seller, Ciera Design, but it was a while ago and it doesn&#039;t look like she sells them anymore.  They are square glassine vellum bags.  I searched Etsy and it looks like this seller, Laserbird, has the same thing available.  They were very easy to print on with our at-home printer.  If you have any questions, don&#039;t hesitate to ask! :) Here is the link for the bags sold by [url=\"http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/92573365\/50-mini-vellum-envelopes?ref=sr_gallery_3&amp;ga_search_query=glassine+vellum+bags&amp;ga_view_type=gallery&amp;ga_ship_to=US&amp;ga_search_type=all\"]Laserbird[\/url].[\/quote] Not far at all!!! I&#039;m getting married at the Barcelo in Riviera Maya 7\/25\/14.. Can&#039;t wait! Thanks so much for looking it up! I really like those bags! Will definitely look into that seller! Thanks again and looking forward to seeing the rest of your projects!","Attachments":[],"Id":1795091,"PostDate":1377560384,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"LaLa1116\" url=\"\/t\/86227\/las&#045;diy&#045;blog\/30#post_1942852\"><p>Thanks you!!\u00a0 You aren't far from us,\u00a0Jersey girl. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> Where in Mexico are you getting married? I purchased the bags from Etsy seller, Ciera Design, but it was a while ago and it doesn't look like she sells them anymore.\u00a0 They are square glassine vellum bags.\u00a0 I searched Etsy and it looks like this seller, Laserbird, has the same thing available.\u00a0 They were very easy to print on with our at-home printer.\u00a0 If you have any questions, don't hesitate to ask! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Here is the link for the bags sold by <a href='http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/92573365\/50-mini-vellum-envelopes?ref=sr_gallery_3&ga_search_query=glassine+vellum+bags&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_ship_to=US&ga_search_type=all' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Laserbird<\/a>.<\/p><\/blockquote> Not far at all!!! I'm getting married at the Barcelo in Riviera Maya 7\/25\/14.. Can't wait! Thanks so much for looking it up! I really like those bags! Will definitely look into that seller! Thanks again and looking forward to seeing the rest of your projects!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Cookieg617@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.193.163.24","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1337724829,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"LoriGran","Id":255715,"Name":"LoriGran","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"acb753bff88fd29ba11af5812cb31fc0","RawContent":"I have another question for you... I am also giving my guests tumblers. How do you plan on packing them?","Attachments":[],"Id":1795328,"PostDate":1377635681,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have another question for you... I am also giving my guests tumblers. How do you plan on packing them?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Cookieg617@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.193.163.24","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1337724829,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"LoriGran","Id":255715,"Name":"LoriGran","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2189f82a09537316960117675d63607a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Lori,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I already have them packed--we bought 35 of them.&amp;nbsp; I stacked them in three and wrapped each stack in bubble wrap.&amp;nbsp; I was surprised at how many I could fit in one case.&amp;nbsp; Hope this helps!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1795978,"PostDate":1377807197,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Lori,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I already have them packed--we bought 35 of them.\u00a0 I stacked them in three and wrapped each stack in bubble wrap.\u00a0 I was surprised at how many I could fit in one case.\u00a0 Hope this helps!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ldoney1013@aol.com","IpAddress":"70.20.201.223","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1328121597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250839.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LaLa1116","Id":250839,"Name":"LaLa1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73939,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b884032819a50da0a83b2732db32f773","RawContent":"Looks great!","Attachments":[],"Id":1796861,"PostDate":1378135045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Looks great!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bride@cancunwedding.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1371829364,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270816.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bridemoonpalace","Id":270816,"Name":"bridemoonpalace","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":75,"TotalPages":8,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":70},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
