81703,"PostDate":1329095303,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> oh man, now I'm considering if I still really want to get involved with the DIY stuff. thanks for sharing.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marilili18@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1327061335,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250233.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marilili","Id":250233,"Name":"marilili","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55358,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2bfbc122bceac226ef353f435735cf8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow Your list challenges my planning, but also informs me a lot.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I was sure to go to Chichen Itza with my guests, but also should consider Xcaret as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; You had a beach wedding, but also at the chapel on 5th avenue? Did you do it all in one day?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you for sharing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1581730,"PostDate":1329100818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow Your list challenges my planning, but also informs me a lot.\u00a0<\/p> <p> I was sure to go to Chichen Itza with my guests, but also should consider Xcaret as well.\u00a0<\/p> <p> You had a beach wedding, but also at the chapel on 5th avenue? Did you do it all in one day?\u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you for sharing!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"silverspoon5@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1327953399,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250745.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tunaandocean","Id":250745,"Name":"tunaandocean","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55358,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1394c84dedfd56130d54ce36ccbf146b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Marilili, I definitely thought the same thing regarding the DIY projects... Especially since you have to make them and than take them! Will most likely think twice about it now as well.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1582160,"PostDate":1329171325,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Marilili, I definitely thought the same thing regarding the DIY projects... Especially since you have to make them and than take them! Will most likely think twice about it now as well.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Quintana_V@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1327102530,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250267.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"QuintanaV","Id":250267,"Name":"QuintanaV","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55358,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b45be6406688b1d93aec9c4f17fee1a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Love the list- Thanks for sharing!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1582224,"PostDate":1329183498,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Love the list- Thanks for sharing!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marinjacks@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.188.199.178","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1320174372,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/prof