{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55358,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7f9790d2c8fc9dfe5db05adea5e19a5","RawContent":"Thanks for the advice!","Attachments":[],"Id":1398550,"PostDate":1297767040,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the advice!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"MaritzaScalici@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1288477261,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233605.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Maritza919","Id":233605,"Name":"Maritza919","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55358,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c38dd716310a30332d1e55e47fb1101","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for the valuable info in a short and sweet post!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1398571,"PostDate":1297768670,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for the valuable info in a short and sweet post!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span><\/span><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:11px;\">Secrets Maroma Beach<\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:11px;\">1.8.2012<\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cjmcnulty1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268030340,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226254.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"c&j","Id":226254,"Name":"c&j","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55358,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21e6da75df9aeb3ce9e70dba162d99be","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thank you! &amp;nbsp;I loved your advice about the guests having such a great time you didn&#039;t need to stress about centerpieces etc. &amp;nbsp;That is so helpful to me! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1400583,"PostDate":1297979034,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thank you! \u00a0I loved your advice about the guests having such a great time you didn't need to stress about centerpieces etc. \u00a0That is so helpful to me! \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"colleen.dawn@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1274827229,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228559.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":171,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mahalo79","Id":228559,"Name":"Mahalo79","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55358,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c6ce68b59a47e4ddd783c7214f4f1e04","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thank you! &amp;nbsp;I loved your advice about the guests having such a great time you didn&#039;t need to stress about centerpieces etc. &amp;nbsp;That is so helpful to me! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1400588,"PostDate":1297979525,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thank you! \u00a0I loved your advice about the guests having such a great time you didn't need to stress about centerpieces etc. \u00a0That is so helpful to me! \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"colleen.dawn@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1274827229,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228559.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":171,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mahalo79","Id":228559,"Name":"Mahalo79","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55358,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e75dee64b105de094bc6cf8521166782","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for the advice... now I can stop stressing about the centerpieces...lol!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1400631,"PostDate":1297982449,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for the advice... now I can stop stressing about the centerpieces...lol!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"CHRISTIANABREWSTER@YAHOO.COM","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1285797554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232790.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CBREWSTER","Id":232790,"Name":"CBREWSTER","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55358,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"287a02f6d29eb23ba086132b8ae30046","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for the great advice,....did you give those journals to your families as gifts? They look really sweet and it would be something my dad would love as he will not let go of any photograph and loves family tree stuff. Did you give a &amp;quot;Dear Daughter&amp;quot; one back to them?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1401353,"PostDate":1298070701,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for the great advice,....did you give those journals to your families as gifts? They look really sweet and it would be something my dad would love as he will not let go of any photograph and loves family tree stuff. Did you give a \"Dear Daughter\" one back to them?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt90ad4.aspx\">http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt90ad4.aspx<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lesleydwatts@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1273619281,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228110.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lesley_mexico_bride","Id":228110,"Name":"lesley_mexico_bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55358,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dbc1209e84234fd421e0d5b5d291a3c2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Awesome Advice! Thank you for your honesty! Looking forward to more advice to come!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1408822,"PostDate":1299024557,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Awesome Advice! Thank you for your honesty! Looking forward to more advice to come!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"star.18@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1283380574,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231975.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"star18","Id":231975,"Name":"star18","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55358,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3284813a3e9839f9948932e40539912e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; THANK YOU - very insightful and helpful&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1408836,"PostDate":1299025674,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> THANK YOU - very insightful and helpful<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"elese.t.m.l@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1297811904,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236844.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lesee","Id":236844,"Name":"lesee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55358,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8daad410b7d85d4da85fb468e74b4385","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Super advice- thanks for taking the time to share.&amp;nbsp; Will be very helpful!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1421400,"PostDate":1300803760,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Super advice- thanks for taking the time to share.\u00a0 Will be very helpful!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimberlyhight@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1297103004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236493.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kim0806","Id":236493,"Name":"kim0806","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55358,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"060813e150896a4c61ed764d396527a9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I found this article interesting because I planned my own DW and did all the travel too, since I work in the industry!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Brides, make sure your TA is willing to communicate directly with your guests and is a \"one point contact\" for everyone. The last thing the bride and groom should be worrying about is travel logistics and collecting payments from their guests. If your TA isn&#039;t willing to take this job off your hands, find a different TA.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Ginger @ Blue Petal&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1422322,"PostDate":1300900482,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I found this article interesting because I planned my own DW and did all the travel too, since I work in the industry!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Brides, make sure your TA is willing to communicate directly with your guests and is a \"one point contact\" for everyone. The last thing the bride and groom should be worrying about is travel logistics and collecting payments from their guests. If your TA isn't willing to take this job off your hands, find a different TA.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ginger @ Blue Petal<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cassie@bluepetalweddings.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1300134073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237813.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":182,"PhotoHeight":118,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cassie South","Id":237813,"Name":"Cassie South","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":38,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
