{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"11260c499511058fcfdd0d4eb3c90d5a","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]kkimi88[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n In the last few weeks we finally found bridesmaid dresses that I and both my girls loved: \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165065\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n \n \n We also found FI&#039;s suit today! FI will be wearing this with a white shirt and turquoise accents. Groomsmen will be wearing the trousers, a white shirt and purple accents.  \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165066\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n As yet I still have no dress, but this is what I&#039;m looking for (anyone more in the know, dress-wise, have any suggestions???) \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165067\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n \n And this is the dress I have bought for my AHR.  \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165068\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img][\/quote] \n \n love the AHR dress, very cute!","Attachments":[],"Id":1762391,"PostDate":1369848155,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>kkimi88<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> In the last few weeks we finally found bridesmaid dresses that I and both my girls loved:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1349019711963_4538\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"165065\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165065\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We also found FI's suit today! FI will be wearing this with a white shirt and turquoise accents. Groomsmen will be wearing the trousers, a white shirt and purple accents.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1349019711963_5319\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"165066\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165066\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As yet I still have no dress, but this is what I'm looking for (anyone more in the know, dress-wise, have any suggestions???)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1349019711963_6102\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"165067\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165067\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> And this is the dress I have bought for my AHR.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1349019711963_6870\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"165068\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165068\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> love the AHR dress, very cute!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"backyyuen@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.87.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1363371265,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267403.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Backy","Id":267403,"Name":"Backy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"027cf129a2121ab988373d05a21ad33d","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Miss J[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I absolutely adore your \"something old\". I was just looking at something like that the other day, looks fabulous in a bouquet![\/quote] \n \n Thanks, I love it too; they&#039;re such a nice personal touch. Plus, I can keep it as a pendant to wear after the wedding :).  \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Peach[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi. I remember noticing some of your posts when you first got engaged, and I was impressed then.  \n \n Now? All I can say is WOW. I LOVE your style, your creativity, your projects, everything!!! I am SO impressed! Awesome job, and please keep posting in your final countdown!  \n \n Oh, and congrats! :)[\/quote] \n \n Thanks, it really is all starting to come together now :D. Can&#039;t believe it&#039;s finally just around the corner.\n \n \n Also, my passport pre-departure booklets have been sent out:\n   \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206224\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206225\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206226\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206227\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206228\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206229\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206230\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206231\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206232\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206233\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206234\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206235\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206236\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206238\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206239\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206240\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206241\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img] \n \n Also, this weekend saw my Bridal shower\/ Bachelorette party. Pictures to come soon!","Attachments":[],"Id":1763835,"PostDate":1370260551,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Miss J<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I absolutely adore your \"something old\". I was just looking at something like that the other day, looks fabulous in a bouquet!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks, I love it too; they're such a nice personal touch. Plus, I can keep it as a pendant to wear after the wedding <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Peach<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi. I remember noticing some of your posts when you first got engaged, and I was impressed then.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Now? All I can say is WOW. I LOVE your style, your creativity, your projects, everything!!! I am SO impressed! Awesome job, and please keep posting in your final countdown!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Oh, and congrats! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks, it really is all starting to come together now <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>. Can't believe it's finally just around the corner.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Also, my passport pre-departure booklets have been sent out:<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206224\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206224\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206225\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206225\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206226\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206226\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206227\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206227\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206228\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206228\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206229\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206229\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206230\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206230\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206231\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206231\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206232\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206232\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206233\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206233\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206234\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206234\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206235\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206235\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206236\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206236\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206238\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206238\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206239\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206239\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206240\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206240\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"206241\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/206241\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, this weekend saw my Bridal shower\/ Bachelorette party. Pictures to come soon!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmymallet@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268405544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/b\/bd\/bd7c2240_user-25597-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kkimi88","Id":226396,"Name":"kkimi88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce07f9f8abeb3aecfed7ac89d550cef3","RawContent":"You are amazingly crafty and I loved reading about you and your FI&#039;s love story! I am so looking forward to seeing photos of the big day!","Attachments":[],"Id":1763996,"PostDate":1370282804,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You are amazingly crafty and I loved reading about you and your FI's love story! I am so looking forward to seeing photos of the big day!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tiffanyandmarkwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"128.172.48.117","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1366928812,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268991.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"brownsugarbride","Id":268991,"Name":"brownsugarbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eef14573a76c019b62f73115bfa7cbce","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; love the suit your FI picked out - mine wants to wear an actual suit! ugh lol. Hopefully I can convince him to wear something like this.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Congrats too! Everything looks great!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1767927,"PostDate":1371131452,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> love the suit your FI picked out - mine wants to wear an actual suit! ugh lol. Hopefully I can convince him to wear something like this.<\/p> <p> Congrats too! Everything looks great!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"julzap@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369845719,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270100.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"itsjuliez","Id":270100,"Name":"itsjuliez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d97f1364ac51a28389040978258456b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; This is amazing. Subscribing for sure!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1769413,"PostDate":1371474896,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> This is amazing. Subscribing for sure!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"craddocksl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.10.25.244","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369194772,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269841.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Shara1984","Id":269841,"Name":"Shara1984","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"213058b19c3891e750f22617c94457a9","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]brownsugarbride[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n You are amazingly crafty and I loved reading about you and your FI&#039;s love story! I am so looking forward to seeing photos of the big day![\/quote] \n \n Thanks so much. We can&#039;t wait either- getting a bit more stressed as we get ever closer though!","Attachments":[],"Id":1769666,"PostDate":1371538289,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>brownsugarbride<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> You are amazingly crafty and I loved reading about you and your FI's love story! I am so looking forward to seeing photos of the big day!<\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks so much. We can't wait either- getting a bit more stressed as we get ever closer though!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmymallet@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268405544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/b\/bd\/bd7c2240_user-25597-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kkimi88","Id":226396,"Name":"kkimi88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0db17fad036da86b3d7cc3d313fd9488","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]itsjuliez[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n love the suit your FI picked out - mine wants to wear an actual suit! ugh lol. Hopefully I can convince him to wear something like this. \n Congrats too! Everything looks great![\/quote] \n Thanks :) \n \n Haha \"picked out\" might be a bit of an overstatement. \"Had it put in front of him and said &#039;yes&#039;\" would probably be more accurate. \n \n Your FI sounds like a glutton for punishment! I think the linen suit is going to leave Adam sweltering enough as it is.","Attachments":[],"Id":1769668,"PostDate":1371538502,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>itsjuliez<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> love the suit your FI picked out - mine wants to wear an actual suit! ugh lol. Hopefully I can convince him to wear something like this.<\/p> <p> Congrats too! Everything looks great!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Haha \"picked out\" might be a bit of an overstatement. \"Had it put in front of him and said 'yes'\" would probably be more accurate.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Your FI sounds like a glutton for punishment! I think the linen suit is going to leave Adam sweltering enough as it is.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmymallet@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268405544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/b\/bd\/bd7c2240_user-25597-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kkimi88","Id":226396,"Name":"kkimi88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2f0be97d4887bf25f618ebf7214f79a","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Shara1984[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n This is amazing. Subscribing for sure![\/quote] \n \n Thanks a lot- on the home straight now!","Attachments":[],"Id":1769669,"PostDate":1371538521,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Shara1984<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> This is amazing. Subscribing for sure!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks a lot- on the home straight now!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmymallet@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268405544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/b\/bd\/bd7c2240_user-25597-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kkimi88","Id":226396,"Name":"kkimi88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51c062f3ce1e5f1fe7886b1971c23e8d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I agree! But he&#039;s one of those people that will wear as suit when needed no matter the temp outside - so we&#039;ll see!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1769922,"PostDate":1371571901,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I agree! But he's one of those people that will wear as suit when needed no matter the temp outside - so we'll see!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"julzap@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369845719,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270100.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"itsjuliez","Id":270100,"Name":"itsjuliez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2942287ba14f42f64b3bf7a3973b4bd3","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]itsjuliez[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I agree! But he&#039;s one of those people that will wear as suit when needed no matter the temp outside - so we&#039;ll see![\/quote] \n \n Haha, completely the opposite of my FI. He&#039;ll be out of his suit jacket and tie as soon as the ceremony&#039;s over, no doubt!","Attachments":[],"Id":1770098,"PostDate":1371622178,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>itsjuliez<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I agree! But he's one of those people that will wear as suit when needed no matter the temp outside - so we'll see!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Haha, completely the opposite of my FI. He'll be out of his suit jacket and tie as soon as the ceremony's over, no doubt!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmymallet@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268405544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/b\/bd\/bd7c2240_user-25597-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kkimi88","Id":226396,"Name":"kkimi88","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":56,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
