{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f254acd2ae5bc86e79bbe2d53673136","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; A couple of weekends ago I tidied up my craft\/ wedding room and repacked all of my wedding bits.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Bubble machines for the reception:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169723\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169723\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Straws and photobooth bits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169724\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169724\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Candles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169725\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169725\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Soooo many candles!:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169726\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169726\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Sand bags for leading to the make shift \"dancefloor\":&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169727\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169727\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; More sandbags:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169728\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169728\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Pre-rolled luminaries:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169729\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169729\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Luminaries:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169730\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169730\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Reverse of luminaries:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169731\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169731\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Some more photo booth bits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169732\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169732\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169733\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169733\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My bracelet, still not decided whether to wear it or not:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169734\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169734\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Luminaries place &#039;names&#039; for the sweetheart table:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169735\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169735\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Chair ties for mine and FIs chairs:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169739\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169739\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; FI&#039;s getting ready t-shirt:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169740\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169740\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reverse:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169741\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169741\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Best man&#039;s getting ready t-shirt: &lt;img data-id=\"169742\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169742\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reverse:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169744\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169744\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Eco-friendly sky lanterns:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169745\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169745\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Photo booth back drop:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169746\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169746\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Turtle brooch from MIL:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169747\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169747\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Craft table with some incomplete projects:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169748\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169748\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; More decs for the gazebo:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169750\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169750\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The result of my first ever play about on a sewing machine:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169751\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169751\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My craft room (the bit without the piles of boxes and suitcases :p:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img data-id=\"169752\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169752\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1681063,"PostDate":1351688565,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> A couple of weekends ago I tidied up my craft\/ wedding room and repacked all of my wedding bits.<\/p> <p> Bubble machines for the reception:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169723\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169723\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Straws and photobooth bits:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169724\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169724\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Candles:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169725\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169725\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Soooo many candles!:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169726\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169726\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sand bags for leading to the make shift \"dancefloor\":\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169727\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169727\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> More sandbags:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169728\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169728\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Pre-rolled luminaries:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169729\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169729\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Luminaries:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169730\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169730\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Reverse of luminaries:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169731\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169731\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Some more photo booth bits:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169732\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169732\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169733\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169733\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My bracelet, still not decided whether to wear it or not:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169734\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169734\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Luminaries place 'names' for the sweetheart table:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169735\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169735\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Chair ties for mine and FIs chairs:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169739\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169739\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> FI's getting ready t-shirt:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169740\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169740\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span>\u00a0Reverse:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169741\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169741\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Best man's getting ready t-shirt: <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169742\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169742\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span>\u00a0Reverse:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169744\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169744\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Eco-friendly sky lanterns:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169745\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169745\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Photo booth back drop:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169746\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169746\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Turtle brooch from MIL:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169747\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169747\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Craft table with some incomplete projects:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169748\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169748\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> More decs for the gazebo:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169750\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169750\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The result of my first ever play about on a sewing machine:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169751\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169751\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My craft room (the bit without the piles of boxes and suitcases <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"169752\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/169752\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmymallet@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268405544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/b\/bd\/bd7c2240_user-25597-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kkimi88","Id":226396,"Name":"kkimi88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be1661f2575857f4dbaaa2b263298f49","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Now that I can at LONG last say that I am getting married &lt;u&gt;this &lt;\/u&gt;year, it has propelled me forwards with a whole range of new crafty projects:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 1. My shoes:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"185649\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/185649\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 2. The revamping of my K &amp;amp; A letters for the sweetheart table:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1359916685513_2608\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"185651\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/185651\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;(before)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1359916685513_3152\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"185652\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/185652\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;(after)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 3. My Photobooth chalk board:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1359916685513_3709\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"185653\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/185653\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;(before)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"185658\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/185658\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"185660\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/185660\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;(after)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1715366,"PostDate":1359902437,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Now that I can at LONG last say that I am getting married <u>this <\/u>year, it has propelled me forwards with a whole range of new crafty projects:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 1. My shoes:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"185649\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/185649\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 2. The revamping of my K & A letters for the sweetheart table:\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1359916685513_2608\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"185651\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/185651\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span>\u00a0(before)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1359916685513_3152\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"185652\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/185652\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span>\u00a0(after)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 3. My Photobooth chalk board:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1359916685513_3709\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"185653\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/185653\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span>\u00a0(before)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"185658\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/185658\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"185660\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/185660\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span>\u00a0(after)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmymallet@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268405544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/b\/bd\/bd7c2240_user-25597-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kkimi88","Id":226396,"Name":"kkimi88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4cba57815177ef727df21af1a7fd86ff","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Great Job!!! Everything looks perfect!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1761275,"PostDate":1369511043,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Great Job!!! Everything looks perfect!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Sdurepos@rogers.com","IpAddress":"99.224.7.43","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1364840444,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268065.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MayFlowers2014","Id":268065,"Name":"MayFlowers2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f877b2b263b6465f936fe593aad1159","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; So, there have been lots of developments in my wedding planning process, as we get steadily nearer to the Big Day! :D.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Last month I bought my wedding dress (please excuse the bad hair and silly look on my face)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1369812233280_2514\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"205363\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205363\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; It was a wonderful day with my Mum, Sister and estranged Grandma. It also felt like my Granddad- who I was close to, but passed away when I was young- was with us: In my dress I wanted a few thing: flowers and poofy. Not only did this fit those bills, but it is also by my fave designer (It&#039;s a Maggie! :D), in my size AND 50% off! It only cost \u00a3500 ($700). He was definitely looking down on me :).&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I also picked up a &#039;backup\/TTD&#039; dress, as I realised there was no way my main dress would fit in anything other than main luggage for the flight.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205372\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205372\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My little sister has also had her first bridesmaid fitting:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"205401\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205401\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; And my Mum has ordered her MOB dress:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"205400\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205400\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This is how I&#039;ve decided I want my hair:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"205364\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205364\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; There were some excess bits from my wedding dress, so I used them to create a new hair flower:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205366\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205366\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve created &#039;Mr&#039; &amp;amp; &#039;Mrs&#039; chair signs:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205365\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205365\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; And direction signs:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205368\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205368\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; And a Thank you sign (sorry it&#039;s upside down!):&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205382\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205382\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I also created a &#039;Shoes Optional&#039; mat&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205367\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205367\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I decorated a ring box:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205369\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205369\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I created floral wrist corsage bracelets for my Mum and my Mother-in-law, and decorated boxes to go with them (please excuse the missing letters!)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205388\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205388\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205395\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205395\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205370\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205370\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We decorated our bubba kegs, which we picked up for a pound in our local \"dollar store\":&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205371\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205371\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205399\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205399\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; And purchased hangers from a fab British Etsy seller, whose details escape me at this moment in time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205373\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205373\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205385\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205385\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Barefoot sandals were handmade for myself, my mum, and my two bridesmaids, as well as cards for them to be attached to:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205374\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205374\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205398\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205398\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We decorated boxes for cuff-links for our Grooms-men and my Dad&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205375\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205375\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205394\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205394\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205396\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205396\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We also purchased a watch for the Best Man- which retails at \u00a360, but we paid \u00a315 for:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205393\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205393\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We decorated our sparklers and created match-books:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205380\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205380\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205391\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205391\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Designed menus (purple for carnivores, turquoise for vegetarians)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205377\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205377\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; And a cake wrap:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205378\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205378\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; A now has matching shoe soles to my &#039;I do&#039; ones:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205379\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205379\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; After a complete cry-fest at our best friends&#039; wedding (our bridesmaid and bestman) I decided to invest in a nice hanky&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205381\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205381\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Welcome booklets for when people get to the resort:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205383\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205383\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205387\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205387\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Decorated the ties for our Grooms-men:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205384\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205384\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Sorted CDs for our OOT bags:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205389\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205389\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Bought a handkerchief for my Mother-in-law, who is also a known crier:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205390\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205390\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; More decorations:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205392\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205392\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Glow Sticks for the reception:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205397\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205397\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m sure there will be things I&#039;ve forgotten, so I&#039;ll probably be back sooner rather than later, but if anyone has any questions, ask away- I&#039;m more than happy to help!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Happy DIYing!! :D&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Kimi x&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1762166,"PostDate":1369801456,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> So, there have been lots of developments in my wedding planning process, as we get steadily nearer to the Big Day! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Last month I bought my wedding dress (please excuse the bad hair and silly look on my face)<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1369812233280_2514\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"205363\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205363\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> It was a wonderful day with my Mum, Sister and estranged Grandma. It also felt like my Granddad- who I was close to, but passed away when I was young- was with us: In my dress I wanted a few thing: flowers and poofy. Not only did this fit those bills, but it is also by my fave designer (It's a Maggie! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>), in my size AND 50% off! It only cost \u00a3500 ($700). He was definitely looking down on me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also picked up a 'backup\/TTD' dress, as I realised there was no way my main dress would fit in anything other than main luggage for the flight.<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205372\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205372\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My little sister has also had her first bridesmaid fitting:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"205401\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205401\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> And my Mum has ordered her MOB dress:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"205400\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205400\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This is how I've decided I want my hair:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"205364\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205364\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> There were some excess bits from my wedding dress, so I used them to create a new hair flower:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205366\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205366\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I've created 'Mr' & 'Mrs' chair signs:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205365\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205365\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> And direction signs:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205368\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205368\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> And a Thank you sign (sorry it's upside down!):<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205382\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205382\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also created a 'Shoes Optional' mat\u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205367\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205367\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I decorated a ring box:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205369\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205369\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I created floral wrist corsage bracelets for my Mum and my Mother-in-law, and decorated boxes to go with them (please excuse the missing letters!)<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205388\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205388\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205395\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205395\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205370\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205370\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We decorated our bubba kegs, which we picked up for a pound in our local \"dollar store\":<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205371\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205371\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205399\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205399\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> And purchased hangers from a fab British Etsy seller, whose details escape me at this moment in time.\u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205373\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205373\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205385\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205385\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Barefoot sandals were handmade for myself, my mum, and my two bridesmaids, as well as cards for them to be attached to:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205374\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205374\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205398\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205398\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We decorated boxes for cuff-links for our Grooms-men and my Dad<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205375\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205375\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205394\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205394\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205396\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205396\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We also purchased a watch for the Best Man- which retails at \u00a360, but we paid \u00a315 for:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205393\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205393\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We decorated our sparklers and created match-books:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205380\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205380\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205391\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205391\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Designed menus (purple for carnivores, turquoise for vegetarians)<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205377\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205377\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> And a cake wrap:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205378\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205378\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> A now has matching shoe soles to my 'I do' ones:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205379\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205379\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> After a complete cry-fest at our best friends' wedding (our bridesmaid and bestman) I decided to invest in a nice hanky<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205381\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205381\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Welcome booklets for when people get to the resort:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205383\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205383\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205387\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205387\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> Decorated the ties for our Grooms-men:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205384\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205384\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sorted CDs for our OOT bags:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205389\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205389\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Bought a handkerchief for my Mother-in-law, who is also a known crier:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205390\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205390\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> More decorations:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205392\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205392\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Glow Sticks for the reception:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205397\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205397\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm sure there will be things I've forgotten, so I'll probably be back sooner rather than later, but if anyone has any questions, ask away- I'm more than happy to help!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy DIYing!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Kimi x<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmymallet@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268405544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/b\/bd\/bd7c2240_user-25597-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kkimi88","Id":226396,"Name":"kkimi88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3300162e8b0f3ae8c82648431a9d73d7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow, you are so organised &amp;amp; crafty!! Wish I was too....&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; When is the big day?!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1762167,"PostDate":1369803714,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow, you are so organised & crafty!! Wish I was too....<\/p> <p> When is the big day?!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jandp.wedding@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369284443,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269886.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Miss J","Id":269886,"Name":"Miss J","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e011cde2a22f7022e991dda392d9fe34","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; It&#039;s 23rd August, though we fly out on the 10th! Getting very close now :D&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We got engaged in 2010 though, so not so much organised as having a looooong time to do things!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1762168,"PostDate":1369803951,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It's 23rd August, though we fly out on the 10th! Getting very close now <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We got engaged in 2010 though, so not so much organised as having a looooong time to do things!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmymallet@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268405544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/b\/bd\/bd7c2240_user-25597-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kkimi88","Id":226396,"Name":"kkimi88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce537634d45558dbd6234504cf8e1f23","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Lovely! Hope you have a fabulous wedding!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Are you having a big wedding in DR or are you having an AHR when back home?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1762170,"PostDate":1369804746,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Lovely! Hope you have a fabulous wedding!<\/p> <p> Are you having a big wedding in DR or are you having an AHR when back home?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jandp.wedding@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369284443,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269886.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Miss J","Id":269886,"Name":"Miss J","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"90ff8c519dd38809a28603c2d962dd26","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We&#039;re not having anything you&#039;d class as &#039;big&#039; either side of the pond. The DW is our &#039;big&#039; event, though there will be 14 of us and then we&#039;ll be having a casual get together at our apartment afterwards, as FI&#039;s Dad unfortunately can&#039;t make it out there with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n \n My &#039;something old&#039; arrived today- photos from my parents&#039; and grandparents&#039; weddings to be attached to my bouquet:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205422\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205422\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205423\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205423\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here&#039;s my home made sand ceremony frame:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205424\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205424\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n My Dad&#039;s tie decoration:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205425\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205425\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1762190,"PostDate":1369820302,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We're not having anything you'd class as 'big' either side of the pond. The DW is our 'big' event, though there will be 14 of us and then we'll be having a casual get together at our apartment afterwards, as FI's Dad unfortunately can't make it out there with us.\u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> <br \/> My 'something old' arrived today- photos from my parents' and grandparents' weddings to be attached to my bouquet:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205422\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205422\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205423\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205423\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here's my home made sand ceremony frame:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205424\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205424\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <br \/> My Dad's tie decoration:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"* \" data-id=\"205425\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/205425\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmymallet@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268405544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/b\/bd\/bd7c2240_user-25597-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kkimi88","Id":226396,"Name":"kkimi88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"581e2c0083f724c7706c820022dcbe3d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi. I remember noticing some of your posts when you first got engaged, and I was impressed then.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Now? All I can say is WOW. I LOVE your style, your creativity, your projects, everything!!! I am SO impressed! Awesome job, and please keep posting in your final countdown!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Oh, and congrats! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1762197,"PostDate":1369821830,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi. I remember noticing some of your posts when you first got engaged, and I was impressed then.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Now? All I can say is WOW. I LOVE your style, your creativity, your projects, everything!!! I am SO impressed! Awesome job, and please keep posting in your final countdown!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Oh, and congrats! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krys85418@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.181.124.120","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1301859312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238489.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Peach","Id":238489,"Name":"Peach","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d20469e2ba756fb618f585e4ac3a33e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I absolutely adore your \"something old\". I was just looking at something like that the other day, looks fabulous in a bouquet!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1762371,"PostDate":1369846218,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I absolutely adore your \"something old\". I was just looking at something like that the other day, looks fabulous in a bouquet!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jandp.wedding@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369284443,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269886.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Miss J","Id":269886,"Name":"Miss J","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":56,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
