find it or who is the designer?[\/quote] \n \n [color=#181818][font=arial][background=rgb(241, 241, 241)]The actual design is Maggie Sottero - Isadora Ann; however I found a knockoff on ebay for a meagre \u00a350 (approx $80) and they have 100% positive feedback, so I thought (for a second dress) it was worth the punt! I&#039;m very excited for its arrival! [\/background][\/font][\/color]","Attachments":[],"Id":1669549,"PostDate":1349188317,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Tulumbride2013<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Everything looks great! Love the i spy and I LOVE the AHR dress. Where did you find it or who is the designer?<\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(241, 241, 241)\">The actual design is Maggie Sottero - Isadora Ann; however I found a knockoff on ebay for a meagre \u00a350 (approx $80) and they have 100% positive feedback, so I thought (for a second dress) it was worth the punt! I'm very excited for its arrival!\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmymallet@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268405544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/b\/bd\/bd7c2240_user-25597-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kkimi88","Id":226396,"Name":"kkimi88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f442a22152641182a25930e16f289eac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Suit trousers arrived for groomsmen today. Now just waiting for FI&#039;s suit (as we ordered it from a cheaper alternative). I&#039;ll post photos when it finally comes through.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My BM will be visiting later this month so I&#039;m excited to get piccies of her in her dress, since they were ordered online and she hasn&#039;t yet tried it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; FI and him BM&#039;s cufflinks arrived today:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"165398\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165398\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;Purple to match my girls.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"165399\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165399\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;Turquoise turtles to match our theme.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Below are a couple more DIY bits that we&#039;ve been working on:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"165405\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165405\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;Our door signs as well, as guests&#039; favours for our OOT bags.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"165406\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165406\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;Door signs along with our mug labels and OOT bag labels. They&#039;ll be attached with ribbon nearer our date.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1669554,"PostDate":1349188738,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Suit trousers arrived for groomsmen today. Now just waiting for FI's suit (as we ordered it from a cheaper alternative). I'll post photos when it finally comes through.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My BM will be visiting later this month so I'm excited to get piccies of her in her dress, since they were ordered online and she hasn't yet tried it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> FI and him BM's cufflinks arrived today:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"165398\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165398\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span>\u00a0Purple to match my girls.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"165399\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165399\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span>\u00a0Turquoise turtles to match our theme.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Below are a couple more DIY bits that we've been working on:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"165405\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165405\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span>\u00a0Our door signs as well, as guests' favours for our OOT bags.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"165406\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165406\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span>\u00a0Door signs along with our mug labels and OOT bag labels. They'll be attached with ribbon nearer our date.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmymallet@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268405544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/b\/bd\/bd7c2240_user-25597-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kkimi88","Id":226396,"Name":"kkimi88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5dc41db78bb017bcd83f3aa8b5638965","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kkimi88\"]\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;line-height:normal;background-color:rgb(241,241,241);\"&gt;The actual design is Maggie Sottero - Isadora Ann; however I found a knockoff on ebay for a meagre \u00a350 (approx $80) and they have 100% positive feedback, so I thought (for a second dress) it was worth the punt! I&#039;m very excited for its arrival! &lt;\/span&gt;[\/quote] When is it coming in? I wanna see some pics when it does!","Attachments":[],"Id":1670104,"PostDate":1349279326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"kkimi88\" url=\"\/t\/79150\/premature&#045;planners&#045;diy&#045;planning&#045;blog\/20#post_1819117\"><p><span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(241,241,241)\">The actual design is Maggie Sottero - Isadora Ann; however I found a knockoff on ebay for a meagre \u00a350 (approx $80) and they have 100% positive feedback, so I thought (for a second dress) it was worth the punt! I'm very excited for its arrival!\u00a0<\/span><\/p><\/blockquote> When is it coming in? I wanna see some pics when it does!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Enjoythepartykm@aol.com","IpAddress":"68.13.213.79","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1343379180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258455.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tulumbride2013","Id":258455,"Name":"Tulumbride2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e314df7482a4970dc233dec315c3d7e","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Tulumbride2013[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n When is it coming in? I wanna see some pics when it does![\/quote] \n \n It&#039;s due at the end of this month! I&#039;m very excited and a bit nervous! \n \n I will DEFINITELY be posting lots of photos, though none of me in it as I&#039;m still losing weight. \n \n Hopefully it will come out nicely... \n \n \n Below are pics of my survival kits. They include  \n hand sanitizer,  \n playing cards, \n postcards, \n door hanger, \n paracetamol and imodium, \n insect bite cream, \n lip balm, \n a lanyard, \n a luggage tag, \n \n and they&#039;re all tied together in lovely organza bags. \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165617\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n \n These are going to make up part of my OOT canvas bags that I&#039;m hoping to get embroidered some time soon! \n \n Happy planning xx","Attachments":[],"Id":1670336,"PostDate":1349335215,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Tulumbride2013<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> When is it coming in? I wanna see some pics when it does!<\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> It's due at the end of this month! I'm very excited and a bit nervous!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I will DEFINITELY be posting lots of photos, though none of me in it as I'm still losing weight.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hopefully it will come out nicely...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Below are pics of my survival kits. They include\u00a0<\/p> <p> hand sanitizer,\u00a0<\/p> <p> playing cards,<\/p> <p> postcards,<\/p> <p> door hanger,<\/p> <p> paracetamol and imodium,<\/p> <p> insect bite cream,<\/p> <p> lip balm,<\/p> <p> a lanyard,<\/p> <p> a luggage tag,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> and they're all tied together in lovely organza bags.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"165617\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165617\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> These are going to make up part of my OOT canvas bags that I'm hoping to get embroidered some time soon!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy planning xx<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmymallet@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268405544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/b\/bd\/bd7c2240_user-25597-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kkimi88","Id":226396,"Name":"kkimi88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e3e12fbb41507d97db4f5e4378bb0a55","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; PS: I&#039;ll post images of the individual components when I get home.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1670337,"PostDate":1349335286,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> PS: I'll post images of the individual components when I get home.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimmymallet@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268405544,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/b\/bd\/bd7c2240_user-25597-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":119,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kkimi88","Id":226396,"Name":"kkimi88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":66882,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7f6eec008eba734b4d84b54bd5b0a6f","RawContent":"Great job. I am going to make sure to follow this post. I can wait to see the final look!","Attachments":[],"Id":1670478,"PostDate":1349352780,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great job. I am going to make sure to follow this post. I can wait to see the final look!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span><\/span><span>2.14.14 I can not wait to marry my very best friend ... Again!<\/span><span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cherinashaw@me.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1346278707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/b