Member","JoinDate":1245642890,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218666.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MayaLove","Id":218666,"Name":"MayaLove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":55251,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51ea8d06d6b7bb3c36f42ca28be39df5","RawContent":"OOh Love your dress choices, maybe I missed it on the forums but have you chosen one yet? I really like &amp;quot;Macey&amp;quot; the fluid shape of the skirt really feels right for a D.W but I love the fit of &amp;quot;Mikaella&amp;quot;. I know from personal experience that the style of the &amp;quot;Mikaella&amp;quot; suited me much better even though I would have imagined to prefer the style of &amp;quot;Macey&amp;quot;. Good luck with your decision.","Attachments":[],"Id":1233622,"PostDate":1253900206,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                OOh Love your dress choices, maybe I missed it on the forums but have you chosen one yet? I really like \"Macey\" the fluid shape of the skirt really feels right for a D.W but I love the fit of \"Mikaella\". I know from personal experience that the style of the \"Mikaella\" suited me much better even though I would have imagined to prefer the style of \"Macey\". Good luck with your decision.\r\n 